<!-- 我（v5「字重」稿 D1）：标题 → 小鸭蛋（学完一门课孵化）→ 身份行 → 继续学习卡 → 订单四格 → 入口行 → 客服/反馈/关于 → 账号操作。
     整页内容套 <scroll-view>：退出提醒的 page-container 武装态会冻结页面级滚动（决策§30·见 utils/exitGuard），
     滚动须发生在 scroll-view 内部。login-sheet/page-container 留在外层当兄弟（浮层不随内容滚）。 -->
<!-- 顶栏（状态栏 + 44 标题条）固定在滚动容器外：内容往上滚时不钻到状态栏/胶囊底下（同首页 hm-bar） -->
<view class="me-bar" style="padding-top: {{statusBarHeight}}px"><view class="me-head"><text class="me-title">我</text></view></view>
<scroll-view class="me-scroll" style="top: {{statusBarHeight + 44}}px" scroll-y="{{true}}" enhanced="{{true}}" show-scrollbar="{{false}}">
<view class="me">

  <!-- 小鸭蛋：hatchKey 非空＝有一门课全部看完 → 孵化；按 hatchKey 做 key，孵化/换课时整个重挂（组件只在 ready 读参数） -->
  <view class="me-egg">
    <block wx:for="{{[hatchKey]}}" wx:key="*this">
      <px-ground kind="egg" hatched="{{!!item}}" hatch-key="{{item}}" />
    </block>
  </view>

  <!-- 身份行：已登录＝头像昵称 + 编辑；登出态＝占位 + 登录 -->
  <view class="me-id">
    <!-- 已登录：头像＝换头像能力键（open-type=chooseAvatar·隐私能力·页尾挂 privacy-sheet），选完直接上传保存；
         按头像任意处「换」角标下沉（同编辑资料页）。未登录：占位，点了打开登录半屏（先登录再换）。 -->
    <button wx:if="{{loggedIn}}" class="me-av-btn" open-type="chooseAvatar" bind:chooseavatar="onChooseAvatar" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="me-av-down" hover-stay-time="100">
      <view class="me-av">
        <image class="me-av-img" src="{{avatar || '/static/hero-full.jpg'}}" mode="aspectFill" />
      </view>
      <view class="k k-sm k-light me-av-k">换</view>
    </button>
    <view wx:else class="me-av me-av-out" bind:tap="onLoginTap"></view>
    <view class="me-id-t">
      <text class="t-sys me-nick">{{nickname}}</text>
      <text wx:if="{{!loggedIn}}" class="t-sys me-id-sub">登录后同步订单与学习进度</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{loggedIn}}" class="k k-sm k-flat me-mini me-mini-weak" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-flat-down" hover-stay-time="100" bind:tap="onEditProfile" data-k="flat" bind:touchstart="onKeyDown" bind:touchend="onKeyUp">编辑</view>
    <view wx:else class="k k-sm k-light me-mini" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-light-down" hover-stay-time="100" bind:tap="onLoginTap" data-k="light" bind:touchstart="onKeyDown" bind:touchend="onKeyUp">登录</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 继续学习（只给已登录的人看·设计稿 me.cont 以 loggedIn 为前提）：有卡 / 取数失败（失败≠没进度，不显假空态）/ 真无课（contLoaded 后）/ 加载中骨架。
       按卡片＝右侧播放键下沉（设计稿按卡时下沉卡内的 data-k 键，整卡不变灰）。
       缩略图：课程数据（publicCourse）不带封面图，这里一直是斜纹占位。 -->
  <block wx:if="{{loggedIn}}">
  <view wx:if="{{cont}}" class="me-card" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="me-card-down" hover-stay-time="100" bind:tap="onContinue">
    <view class="me-thumb"></view>
    <view class="me-card-t">
      <text class="t-sys me-card-sub">继续学习 · {{cont.courseTitle}}</text>
      <text class="me-card-main">{{contMain || cont.lessonName}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="k k-ink me-play"><px-i name="play" /></view>
  </view>
  <view wx:elif="{{contFailed}}" class="me-card">
    <px-anim name="signal" size="2" />
    <text class="me-card-main me-card-grow">没连上网络</text>
    <view class="k k-sm k-light me-mini" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-light-down" hover-stay-time="100" bind:tap="onRetryCont" data-k="light" bind:touchstart="onKeyDown" bind:touchend="onKeyUp">重试</view>
  </view>
  <!-- 无学习记录：设计稿此处有「扫码激活」键——老板拍板不做应用内扫码/输码（用微信扫实体激活卡进入），只留文字 -->
  <view wx:elif="{{contLoaded}}" class="me-card">
    <text class="me-card-main me-card-grow">还没有学习记录</text>
  </view>
  <view wx:else class="me-card">
    <view class="me-thumb skel"></view>
    <view class="me-card-t">
      <view class="skel me-skel-l"></view>
      <view class="skel me-skel-s"></view>
    </view>
  </view>
  </block>

  <!-- 订单四格（v5 D1）：数字 + 标签；三格有单都亮紫灯；「全部」格换箭头。三格带 data-tab 直落分栏（order-list.ts query.tab 契约） -->
  <view class="me-grid">
    <view class="k k-flat me-cell" data-tab="pending" bind:tap="onOrders" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-flat-down" hover-stay-time="100" data-k="flat" bind:touchstart="onKeyDown" bind:touchend="onKeyUp">
      <view class="me-cell-top">
        <text class="me-cell-n {{counts.pending && counts.pending !== '0' ? '' : 'me-cell-zero'}}">{{counts.pending || '-'}}</text>
        <px-i wx:if="{{counts.pending && counts.pending !== '0'}}" name="led" tone="#8a5ae0" />
      </view>
      <text class="t-sys me-cell-l">待支付</text>
    </view>
    <view class="k k-flat me-cell" data-tab="paid" bind:tap="onOrders" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-flat-down" hover-stay-time="100" data-k="flat" bind:touchstart="onKeyDown" bind:touchend="onKeyUp">
      <view class="me-cell-top">
        <text class="me-cell-n {{counts.paid && counts.paid !== '0' ? '' : 'me-cell-zero'}}">{{counts.paid || '-'}}</text>
        <px-i wx:if="{{counts.paid && counts.paid !== '0'}}" name="led" tone="#8a5ae0" />
      </view>
      <text class="t-sys me-cell-l">待发货</text>
    </view>
    <view class="k k-flat me-cell" data-tab="shipped" bind:tap="onOrders" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-flat-down" hover-stay-time="100" data-k="flat" bind:touchstart="onKeyDown" bind:touchend="onKeyUp">
      <view class="me-cell-top">
        <text class="me-cell-n {{counts.shipped && counts.shipped !== '0' ? '' : 'me-cell-zero'}}">{{counts.shipped || '-'}}</text>
        <px-i wx:if="{{counts.shipped && counts.shipped !== '0'}}" name="led" tone="#8a5ae0" />
      </view>
      <text class="t-sys me-cell-l">待收货</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{entries.orders.visible}}" class="k k-flat me-cell" bind:tap="onOrders" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-flat-down" hover-stay-time="100" data-k="flat" bind:touchstart="onKeyDown" bind:touchend="onKeyUp">
      <view class="me-cell-top me-cell-arrow"><px-i name="arrow" /></view>
      <text class="t-sys me-cell-l">{{entries.orders.label}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 入口行（标题/可见性走 CMS entries） -->
  <view class="me-rows">
    <view wx:if="{{entries.courses.visible}}" class="me-row" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-row-down" bind:tap="onCourses">
      <text class="me-row-t">{{entries.courses.label}}</text><px-i name="arrow" />
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{entries.aftersales.visible}}" class="me-row" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-row-down" bind:tap="onAfterSales">
      <text class="me-row-t">{{entries.aftersales.label}}</text><px-i name="arrow" />
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{entries.address.visible}}" class="me-row" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-row-down" bind:tap="onAddress">
      <text class="me-row-t">{{entries.address.label}}</text><px-i name="arrow" />
    </view>
    <!-- 数据共享授权：设计稿未画，但合规守卫要求「我」页可直达（隐私政策承诺随时可撤回·M5 前置闸1），放入口行末 -->
    <view wx:if="{{entries.consent.visible}}" class="me-row" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-row-down" bind:tap="onConsent">
      <text class="me-row-t">{{entries.consent.label}}</text><px-i name="arrow" />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="me-links">
    <view wx:if="{{entries.kefu.visible}}" class="me-link" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-row-down" bind:tap="onKefu">{{entries.kefu.label}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{entries.kefu.visible && entries.feedback.visible}}" class="me-sep"></view>
    <view wx:if="{{entries.feedback.visible}}" class="me-link" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-row-down" bind:tap="onFeedback">{{entries.feedback.label}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{(entries.kefu.visible || entries.feedback.visible) && entries.about.visible}}" class="me-sep"></view>
    <view wx:if="{{entries.about.visible}}" class="me-link" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-row-down" bind:tap="onAbout">{{entries.about.label}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="me-tab-space"></view>
</view>
</scroll-view>

<!-- 登录授权半屏（R1·软门槛）：未同意登录进「我」页弹出、可「暂不登录」关掉继续逛·经 lib/loginGate 单例驱动 -->
<login-sheet bind:login="onLoggedIn" />

<!-- 误触退出提醒（决策§30）：隐形容器武装拦第一次返回 →「再按一次退出」·仅安卓返回键·见 utils/exitGuard -->
<page-container show="{{exitGuardArmed}}" overlay="{{false}}" duration="{{0}}" bindbeforeleave="onExitGuardBeforeLeave" />

<!-- v5 全屏像素特效层（撒花/转场·lib/pxFx）：页面根下、不进滚动容器 -->
<px-fx id="fx" />

<!-- 隐私授权弹窗：头像键 chooseAvatar 属隐私接口，未授权时由 lib/privacyGate 唤起（守卫 rw-mp-privacy-gated） -->
<privacy-sheet />
